##### GET ALL USERS
GET http://127.0.0.1:5001/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

##### DELETE ALL USERS AND ADMINS
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:5001/api/users/all
Content-Type: application/json

##### REGISTER ADMIN
POST http://127.0.0.1:5001/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Satyanarayana Akella",
  "email": "akella.satyanarayana2@gmail.com",
  "country_code": "+91",
  "phone_number": "8985723593",
  "password": "Satyanarayana@13",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

##### FIRST LOGIN (paste token from register response loginLink query param)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5001/api/users/login/verify?token=PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

##### PASSWORD LOGIN (only works after first-login verify)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5001/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

